.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt PATINA-EMOJI 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-emoji
.Nd the emoji picker
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens a popup in the middle of the screen with a search box and the emoji by
category.
Picking one types it into the window that had the focus, by
.Ql Commit
on
.Pq com.sectorflabs.Patina.Input ,
the way dictation does:
through the clipboard, which is given back afterwards.
The compositor opens it on Ctrl+Super+Space or Super+period, the
.Ic emoji
key in
.Ic [keys] ;
running it while it's open closes it.
.Pp
Typing searches by name, so
.Dq thumbs
and
.Dq red heart
find theirs.
The arrow keys move over the emoji, Enter or a click picks, Tab and Shift+Tab
move between categories, and Escape, or switching to another window, closes.
The emoji picked last are kept first, under Recent.
.Pp
The emoji are drawn as Twemoji, graphics by Twitter and other contributors,
licensed CC-BY 4.0.
It needs the Patina compositor, which has the
.Ql Commit
call.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev PATINA_SKIN
The skin, by name.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $XDG_DATA_HOME/patina-emoji/recent
The emoji picked last, a line each, newest first.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-compositor 1 ,
.Xr patina-dictate 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
